<title>JAPAN: TDK Corp jumps to new record high.</title>
<headline>TDK Corp jumps to new record high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in TDK Corp jumped to a new record high in Friday morning trade as foreign investors, and dealers seeking fast profits, flocked to the shares, encouraged by the firm's good earnings, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0200 GMT, the shares of the electronic parts maker were 240 yen higher at 9,040.</p>
